    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nHouse Type C - 169 sqm with two living rooms and kitchen/dining room on ground floor. 3 bedrooms and 2 bathrooms on first floor. 2 bedrooms and shower room on upper floor.\n\nNumber 57 is completed and ready for snagging and valuation so you could be moved in very quickly!\n\nNigel Clarke Developments and Sherry FitzGerald Radford are delighted to bring this wonderful new development of A rated homes to the market. This development with a mix of detached, semi-detached and terraced homes is beside the new Loreto Secondary School, Min Ryan Park and Playground and approximately 1 km to the sites for the new Educate Together National School and Selskar College. Ballynagee benefits from proximity to Wexford Town, retail parks and local amenities. The location of this development couldn't be more accessible for the N25 and N11 at the Whitford roundabout 1.2 km away. \n\nType C homes are 169 sqm, 5 bedroom semi-detached homes with two living rooms and kitchen/dining room along with wheelchair accessible WC on the ground floor, 3 bedrooms (one with en-suite) and family bathroom on the first floor and two further bedrooms (or bedroom and study) and shower room on the second floor.\n\nFINISHESQualifies for Help to Buy Scheme \nBlock builtAir to Water Heating Finished internally in a white easy to maintain paint finish\nKitchen with island unit\nQuartz counter top and backsplashTiling included: Ensuite shower and 2nd floor shower floor and shower surround, main bathroom floor and 2 walls over bath; downstairs WC floor.Gardens levelled and seededDouble glazed windows and hardwood doorsCharging point for Electric Cars Outside Tap Outside Electric Socket\n\nINTERNAL PHOTOS PROVDED ARE SCHEMATA PHOTOS ONLY\nOutside photo is of an equivalent home already built.\nRoom sizes are for guide only"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 4.9m x 2.2m\nincluding guest WC of 1.5m x 1.5 with WC and WHB\n\nLiving Room - 4.9m x 3.9m\nwith front facing window and double doors to kitchen/dining area\n\nKitchen/Dining Room - 6m x 4.5m\nwith side window and rear window. Fully fitted kitchen with island unit. Quartz countertops. Direct access into rear sitting/living room\n\nSitting/Living Room 2 - 4m x 3.6m\nwith skylight and French doors to rear garden\n\nFIRST FLOOR - \n\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.9m x 3.4m\nwith en-suite\n\nEn-Suite - 2.2m x 1.5m\nwith tiled floor and shower surround, WC. WHB and shower\n\nBedroom 2 - 4m x 3.6m\n\n\nBedroom 3 - 3m x 2.5m\n\n\nBathroom - 2.6m x 1.7m\nwith tiled floor and bath surround, WC, WHB and bath with shower over\n\nSECOND FLOOR - \n\n\nBedroom 4 - 4.8m x 2.4m\nplus dormer area 1.5m x 1.1m\n\nBedroom 5 - 3.6m x 3m\nwith roof light\n\nShower Room - 2.4m x 1.8m\nwith WC, WHB and shower. Tiled floor and shower surround\n\n"
      },
